app.vulkan.no_loader = schist: e leai se loader Vulkan i lenei faiga, o lea e leai ai se auala e tusi ai ata.\n\nE tusi ata Schist e ala i Vulkan, ae e leʻi faapipiiina `libvulkan.so.1`.\nE manaʻomia uma le loader ma se driver:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-icd-loader vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install libvulkan1 mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install vulkan-loader mesa-vulkan-drivers\n
app.vulkan.override_missing = schist: e lē o iai le driver Vulkan ua faasino i ai lenei sauniga.\n\nUa seti {var}, ma o le setiina e *sui atoa* ai le saʻiliga a le loader mo\ndriver, ae lē faaopoopo i ai. O lea la, o faila nei e lē o iai\no le lisi atoa lea o driver — ma e lē vaaia e so o se polokalame Vulkan\ni lenei sauniga se driver, tusa lava pe tele ua faapipiiina:\n\n{missing}\n    {var}={value}\n\nFaasino i se manifest o loo iai — e tuu e driver ua faapipii a latou manifest i\n/usr/share/vulkan/icd.d — pe aveese lona seti ma tuu le loader e saʻili lava.\nAfai e seti lenei mea e se faila faatulagaga (le `env =` a Hyprland, se faila\nfaaopoopo systemd environment.d, po o se talaaga shell), e tatau ona suia i inā,\nma e manaʻomia ona toe saini fou ina ia oo le suiga i mea ua uma ona ola.\n
app.vulkan.override_note = \nUa seti {var} i le {value}, ma e sui atoa ai le saʻiliga a le loader:\nafai e leai se tasi o na manifest e mo lenei masini, o le aveese o lona seti\no le mea muamua lea e taumafai ai.\n
app.vulkan.no_driver = schist: e leai se driver Vulkan ua faapipiiina, o lea e leai ai se auala e tusi ai ata.\n\nE tusi ata Schist e ala i Vulkan. Ua faapipii le loader ae ua lipotia mai e leai\nse driver — e leai se driver ua lesitala i nofoaga uma e lua e saʻili ai:\n\n{dirs}\n\nE ese le afifi o le loader mai afifi o driver, o lea e masani ai ona na o le tasi\nle afifi o loo misi.\n\nFaapipii le driver mo le GPU o lenei masini:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n\nE iai le driver a NVIDIA i lana lava afifi (`nvidia-utils` i Arch,\n`nvidia-driver` i Debian). I se masini faafoliga, po o se nofoaga e leai se\ndriver GPU e faapipii, e aogā le rasteriser faakomepiuta:\n`vulkan-swrast` i Arch, ma o se vaega o `mesa-vulkan-drivers` i isi faiga. E\ntelegese, ae e mafai ona amata.\n{overridden}
app.vulkan.no_device = schist: ua faapipii se driver Vulkan ae e leai se masini e ofo mai e tusi ai ata.\n\nAtonu e lē lagolagoina e le driver lenei GPU, pe e lē mafai ona oo i ai —\ni luga o SSH, po o totonu o se container, e masani ona misi /dev/dri.\nE lipotia e `vulkaninfo --summary` mea e vaaia e le loader.\n\nE mafai e le rasteriser faakomepiuta ona tusi ata e aunoa ma se GPU, pe afai\no le tulaga lea o lenei masini: `vulkan-swrast` i Arch, ma o se vaega o\n`mesa-vulkan-drivers` i Debian ma Fedora.\n
app.vulkan.skip_hint = Ina ia amata pea Schist ma tuu e lē manuia i lana lava auala, seti {var}=1.
